<http://knowledgemap.kr/koid/id/f1483be14a505650fd57d7513bebbf51> skos:prefLabel "에볼라바이러스"@ko,"Ebola virus disease"@en;
koid:pathogenLabel "Ebola virus";
a schema:InfectiousDisease;
dcterms:identifier "DIS_0018";
koid:pathogen wd:Q808;
koid:definition "에볼라바이러스(Ebola virus) 감염에 의한 급성 발열성·출혈성 질환입니다.";
